1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:07,500
In 2020 Citibank wired $900M
to Revlon's lenders by mistake.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:14,000
The screen looked right.
Nobody read it twice.

3
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Every air waybill gets typed
by hand at least once.

4
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:33,000
The glasses watch the paper while
a screen reader watches the typing.

5
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Validators alone miss most real errors.

6
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:49,000
A local verdict streams in about
two hundred milliseconds.

7
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:55,000
One image-grounded Spark call refines it.
Verdict: blocked, AWB check digit invalid,

8
00:00:55,500 --> 00:01:00,000
fix proposes the paper value.

9
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Validators block instantly and for free.
The model gets one call to explain

10
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:11,500
and propose the fix.

11
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Paper matches typed, but the documents
disagree with each other.

12
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:23,000
Warn on the cross-doc gap,
escalated to Spark.

13
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:47,000
Every decision lands here with its reasoning,
its latency and cost, and an append-only audit trail.

14
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:06,000
The POD note reads 2 cartons damaged.
A claim draft follows:

15
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:12,000
carrier plus BOL reference, 2 damaged,
amount left for the adjuster.

16
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Check digits alone collapse on the hard split.
The tiered pipeline holds 98.8 to 100% recall

17
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:27,000
at about a third of a cent per form for text,
a cent and a half with full vision.

18
00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:31,500
The vision arm reads paper straight
from degraded pixels, including five

19
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:35,500
validator-blind near-miss forms,

20
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:43,000
and abstains to needs-human
when it cannot read a field.

21
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:51,000
Validators first, always free.
A local pass over crops.

22
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:55,500
Cloud only on disagreement,
one Spark call per verdict.

23
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:59,500
What ships next: on-glasses recording
and local Glimmer weights.
